        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available from 1st November 2026. Please note this property is unfurnished.\n\n**When applying for this property, please provide as much information as possible about all applicants. The more information we have the better as we receive a large amount of applications daily**\n\nGet Let is delighted to offer this unfurnished, four bedroom semi-detached house to the letting market.\n\nThe accommodation in brief comprises entrance hallway, large reception room to the front, dining room to the rear, a modern kitchen which is equipped with a fridge/freezer, oven, hob, dishwasher, and a washing machine, downstairs WC. Upstairs presents four bedrooms, three doubles (master en-suite) and one single. A main bathroom completes the accommodation. \nThe rear garden is paved and low maintenance. To the front there is parking for two cars. The property is attached to separate mews and the driveway is shared with occupants of the mews, (the rear gardens are separated with a garden fence).\n\nLocated on the Carpenterstown Road, 1km from Coolmine Train Station and within a short drive to Castleknock Village, The Phoenix Park & Blanchardstown Shopping Centre. The N3 and M50 are within a short drive of the property. Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport are within a twenty minute drive.\n\nTo register your interest please email Michelle Hoare of Get Let by clicking on `Email Advertiser` to the right of this advertisement. Please submit a brief application with details of how many people it is for and when you wish to move home. Private viewings shall take place by appointment only.\n\n Get Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, PSRA number 002324.\n\n"
      },
